\u2500\u2500 STORYBOARD \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500
The hook is a stark contradiction: a promo shot of the 'safest plane' followed immediately by the number of deaths. We introduce the core technical flaw—a single sensor—and its terrifying result, an unstoppable nosedive, using clear animations. The human cost is then driven home with evidence from the two crash sites in quick succession. The emotional peak is the reveal of corporate knowledge and negligence, using congressional hearing footage. The consequence is visualized with fleets of grounded planes. The story closes with an unresolved, outrage-inducing fact—no accountability—to drive comments. The emotional arc moves from intrigue to shock to anger.
